Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,YUMBOO!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,YUMBU!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.35,0:01:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, she's not waking up. My.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick trapped her mind\Nin the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.57,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament's gotten way out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.71,0:01:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's a\Nmind-warping psycho on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.91,0:01:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just being honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.99,0:01:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you all go to the next duel and\NI'll stay here and keep an eye on mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.53,0:01:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay, and besides,\Nwe don't all need to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.97,0:01:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.31,0:01:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, the next duel of the\Nfinals is about to start, so go watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.81,0:01:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,If Mai were all right,\Nshe'd say the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.63,0:01:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you go out there\Nand be strong for Mai,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.35,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll sit by her\Nside till you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.23,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.55,0:01:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been more\Nsure than I am right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.13,0:01:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone here has taught me so much\Nabout being brave and facing my fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.75,0:01:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,including Mai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The way she stood up to Merrick\Nin that duel was so incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.87,0:02:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are all so strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and the way you support each other\Nand support me is amazing. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.41,0:02:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it's my turn to help out, and\NI can start by being here for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.19,0:02:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the least I can do, and it's\Nreally important to me, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.54,0:02:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nicely said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You convinced me, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the Eighth Duelist arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the next match of the Battle\NCity finals will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this Eighth Duelist, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope they're\Nnot working for Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.94,0:02:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have enough people on bed rest already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,My Egyptian God card will crush\Nthis Eighth Duelist, whoever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, come in. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, what's the update?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra has been successfully\Nscammed into the Kaiba Corp mainframe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Our network is translating\Nthe Egyptian text on the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be able to\Ndecipher its meaning and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.81,0:03:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,find out all the secrets\Nof this card in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.95,0:03:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.86,0:03:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact me as soon as you get the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.03,0:03:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If duelist number eight does not\Narrive in the next five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.41,0:03:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,an automatic victory will\Nbe awarded to Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.23,0:03:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, I must speak to you right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Save it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.91,0:03:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to request an emergency landing\Nto get your friend to a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You can forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you already when your friend\NBakura couldn't deal with his injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.49,0:03:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,My tournament stops for no one. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, the guy's got a\Nheart of gold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.53,0:03:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, his cheeks must hurt\Nfrom smiling so much. Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sunshine's gonna advance to the next\Nround if his opponent doesn't show.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.57,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek, soon your winged\Ndragon will be in my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my competition came to\Nhis senses and decided to back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.49,0:03:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning this duel was even\Neasier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The eighth duelist is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems this duel will take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.37,0:04:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba will face...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He will face...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve\Nshowing up late to duel me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.35,0:04:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the thought of facing\Na duelist as superior
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,as myself make you second-guess\Nyour own abilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You may call me Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu Ishtar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my way, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.05,0:04:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, she's the woman that you\Nand I met at the Egyptian exhibit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.17,0:05:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have uncovered many\Nmysteries about you and these
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,ancient carvings using the\Nmagic of my Millennium Necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.03,0:05:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we meet again, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've come to win back Obelisk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What I've come for is\Nof greater importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come here to save\Nmy brother. Brother? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,For the past 5,000 years, an Ishtar has\Nstood guard over the pharaoh's tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.87,0:05:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Only Merrick, he turned against us, and\Nthe evil within him is even stronger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He is my brother. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One Ishtar was bad enough. Who needs two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.17,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't be any worse than Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for once, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there is good buried\Ndeep within my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.53,0:05:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only room in here for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.99,0:05:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.11,0:05:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you remember, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:06:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,my Millennium Necklace has the power\Nto show me events that are yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.85,0:06:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And right now, it tells me\Nyou will lose this duel to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough with the Millennium Items!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in that\Nnonsense, is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,just because you were foolish\Nenough to hand me Obelisk the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.03,0:06:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tormentor doesn't mean that I\Nwon't use it to destroy you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't appreciate you using my tournament\Nto solve your personal family issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.35,0:06:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I planned this with one goal in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.93,0:06:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,to reclaim my place as the\Nnumber one duelist in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that it was my idea for
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you to organize the\NBattle City Tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,To lure duelists like Merrick. Say, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And my plan worked,\Nfor my brother is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the hardest task is yet to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil within him must be stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And this mission can only be accomplished\Nwith the help of the great pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.61,0:06:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,which is precisely why Yugi needed\Nto enter this tournament as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.13,0:07:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,For this ancient pharaoh dwells\Nwithin Yugi's Millennium Puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.47,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You went through all of that trouble\Njust because of some Egyptian fairy tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by superstitious nitwits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not deny your heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.09,0:07:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,As I've shown you before, you too can\Ntrace your origins back to ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, that is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.99,0:07:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a far better duelist than you,\Nand I plan to win this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what you and your\Ndemented brother may believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You made two mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The first was handing Obelisk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.05,0:07:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The second was expecting it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That card is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.55,0:07:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon I'll possess the\Nother two Egyptian God cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have the world's most powerful\Ndeck, and you can do a favor for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your Hocus Pocus nonsense\Nto someone else's tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,because to me, it's a\Ncolossal waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.69,0:07:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Roland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin this duel at once. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.27,0:08:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace predicts that\NKaiba's lack of faith will be his downfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.09,0:08:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a magic trick\Nto predict your demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So I will summon the mighty Force Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he'll place a card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.59,0:08:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.73,0:08:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.17,0:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.51,0:08:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the power of my Millennium\NNecklace shall predict
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.99,0:08:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,your every move and\Nyou will suffer defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba may be a skilled duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's no match for the\Npower of a Millennium item.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kaibakorp mainframe\Ncan't seem to decipher
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,the last line of text on\Nthe Winged Dragon of Rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Keldo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:08:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see that, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't even look at that card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Millennium necklace shows\Nher events before they occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So she knows everything that's\Ngonna happen before it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.35,0:09:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This sounds just like that\Ntrick Esperoba played on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Joey, but I can assure\Nyou that this is not a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashizu's power is very much real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What those fools don't realize is\Nthat my sister's power has limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now activate a powerful magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Misfire of Doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That card allows her to select two\Ncards from my hand and discard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I get to do the\Nsame thing to her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose Polymerization and Kaiser Glider.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.07,0:09:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't possibly have known\NI had those two cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, she's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.25,0:09:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough trickery!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your cards right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.33,0:09:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret ever having\Nplayed that magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you to discard Revival\NMagic and Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.87,0:10:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.75,0:10:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That ends my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember Isisoo's\Ndueling tactics all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She may have defeated me\Nwhen I was a weak child,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But now she wouldn't\Nstand a chance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Shizu, you'll never transform me\Nback into the pathetic fool I once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my brother's kind and gentle\Nspirit is in there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.67,0:10:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will set him free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, in the name of the Tomb\NKeepers, Merrick will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother has been getting in\Nmy way, so he must be banished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye. Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see which is stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.59,0:10:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tricks or my skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Force Raider Attacker Keldo, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well now, maybe your\Nfuture isn't so bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps if you spent\Nless time predicting the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.49,0:11:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,future and more time\Nfocusing on your dueling,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.95,0:11:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't understand, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.39,0:11:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I am aware of every twist\Nand turn that will occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.31,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly what card you're\Ngoing to play before you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and I know how you're going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of\Nimbecile you think I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.33,0:11:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but your little mind games\Nwon't work on me, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the perfect plan\Nwith the magic card shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,in my hand and the trap\Ncrush card face down on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The field. I'll be able\Nto completely devastate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.41,0:11:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu. She won't know what\Nhit her until it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I still think it's gonna be a tough duel
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu may be able to see\Nthe future, but Kaiba's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.95,0:11:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Got an Egyptian god\Ncard. Now I'll place one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,more card face down on\Nthe field and end my turn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This card will be needed later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll never expect my next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy every powerful monster in\Nher deck using Shrink and Crush card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Mudora.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.03,0:12:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I am left with no choice\Nbut to call upon the powers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,of my Millennium Necklace\Nto ensure my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And it shows me that\NKaiba will attempt to win
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,this duel using the Egyptian\Ngod card I gave to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.43,0:12:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Obelisk will fall by\Nmy hand, causing Kaiba's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And his loss shall be my gain as I move\Ncloser to rescuing my dear brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.17,0:12:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Patience, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I used up my patience waiting\Nfor you to show up tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.39,0:12:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The less I have to hear about\Nyour insane brother, the better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you insult my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret those words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.11,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't blame Seto Kaiba\Nfor his frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I, too, am growing tired\Nof Eshizu's speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now play the magic\Ncard Sword of Dagra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It increases the attack strength\Nof my Mudora by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, attack his Virus Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you. Face down cards, go you're
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.47,0:13:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,finished first up is my shrink card
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,this cuts my force raiders attack points
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,in half in order to activate his crush
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.85,0:13:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,card kaiba had to first lower his own\Nmonster's attack points and as if that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,weren't enough watch as my crush card\Ndestroys both Monsters on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as every powerful\Nmonster in your entire deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's move was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.63,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were a Shizu,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd trade in that Millennium Necklace\Nfor a crystal ball or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If she can see the future, why\Ndidn't she see that coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now every monster in your deck with over\N1,500 attack points goes to the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.57,0:14:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're left with\Nnothing but a deck full of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,worthless monsters who pose\Nabsolutely no threat to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my Millennium Necklace, I\Ndon't need a powerful monster to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.57,0:14:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch as I stop you from\Nattacking me for three whole turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Swords of Revealing Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.25,0:14:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If my future's bleak,\Nwhy are you stalling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.43,0:15:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stalling, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate dictates our moves, and it's\Nyour destiny to lose. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.58,0:15:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can clearly envision your downfall\Nas you can't help but destroy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I have a prediction of my own?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your swords of\Nrevealing light are gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you with my Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So while you count on fate to win\Nthis, I'll count on brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, and I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.35,0:15:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.37,0:15:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.63,0:15:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Virus cannon. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,She may have prevented my\Nmonster from attacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can still play this magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.07,0:15:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, she\Nwon't know what hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching a Shizu toy with Kaiba's\Nmind is quite amusing. I always
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.89,0:15:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,knew she had a dark side stand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,back it's my move and i summon dark
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.31,0:16:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,gremlin in defense mode and then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll place this card face down very
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,well i shall draw one card but i\Ndon't need it yet So I shall pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.71,0:16:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You stopped me from attacking\Nyou for three turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet you still can't destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your prediction, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.47,0:16:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,you shall draw the card that will\Nlead to your demise in two more turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even more insane\Nthan I first thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm gonna draw are cards\Nthat will lead to your own demise, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel Monsters is about skill and\Npower, not very dust and fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got such a way with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.23,0:16:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a regular William Shakespeare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a couple of words for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,However, there's a lady present.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All this talk is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.55,0:16:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for action. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The translator's working now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.39,0:17:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we'll know all the secrets\Nof the winged dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And then no one can stop\Nyou. Make your move,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,for the end is near You fascinate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you speak so much about\Nyour victory Yet other than
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.05,0:17:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,stall for more time with your\Nswords of revealing light,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you've done absolutely nothing to win this\NAnd next turn your swords will be gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.47,0:17:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Allowing me to strike back and\Ndefeat you once and for all, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.77,0:17:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So beware I believe you'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My Sacrifices Blast Trap card will\Nseal his fate in my next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace was indeed correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for you to make your\Nfinal move has arrived, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,For three whole turns, you failed\Nto summon a single monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:18:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I highly doubt that I'm\Nfacing any sort of danger at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So spare me the threats.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.65,0:18:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My swords are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You are free to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for stating the obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.39,0:18:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And now stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to destroy Ishizu\Nwith the very card she gave to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus created three all-powerful cards\Nthat were never released to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,They are known as the Egyptian God Cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.35,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormented, Slifer the Sky\NDragon, and the Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot fathom the magical\Nenergy contained within.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus could not control the\Npower of the cards he created.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They threatened to\Noverwhelm and destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Rare Hunters then stole these\Ncards to build all-powerful decks,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but they didn't steal all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This card is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.41,0:18:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to retrieve one in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You may borrow it during the\Ntournament, but I expect it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.65,0:19:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She will regret the day she handed\Nme an Egyptian God card because that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.57,0:19:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,was the day she sealed her doom and\Nnow it's time to finish her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.31,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu will be eliminated by the very\Nbeast that she placed in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Obelisk the Tormentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I play this card, Dark\NGremlin, attack her life points now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.03,0:19:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, did you predict\Nthat would happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark Gremlin is the least\Nof your problems, Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.19,0:19:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I plan to destroy you\Nwith my Egyptian God card now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your future is decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.47,0:19:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Use Obelisk and you'll be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.35,0:19:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.75,0:19:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can save you from Obelisk's wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't resist it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.25,0:20:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For the end is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the king.
